## Quick start

This ZIP contains:
- `config.json` — DAB template configuration (scalar fields)
- `agents_manifest.json` — full agent topology manifest (tools, retrievers, LLMs, workflow pattern)
{{#hasCICD}}
- CI/CD workflow file
{{/hasCICD}}

### 1. Initialize the DAB project

```bash
databricks bundle init https://github.com/databricks-solutions/agentops-stacks \
  --config-file config.json
```

This creates a `{{{projectName}}}/` directory with the Databricks Asset Bundle skeleton.

### 2. Generate agent files from manifest

```bash
cp agents_manifest.json {{{projectName}}}/agents_manifest.json
cd {{{projectName}}}
python scripts/generate_agents.py
```

This reads the manifest and generates agent implementations, router wiring, and DAB workflow resources based on your canvas topology.

### 3. Deploy

```bash
databricks bundle deploy -t dev
```

